ComfyUI_JR_MiniMaxH3Node
Copyright 2026 JR MiniMax H3 Node contributors

This product includes independent node implementations informed by the documented behavior of
ComfyUI-DaSiWa-Nodes and Comfyui-minimaxh3-FBcache-shendumao. No source files from either
reference repository are distributed with this project. The MiniMax H3 prompt constraint
strategy was reorganized and rewritten after reviewing the latter reference. Exact reference
commits, attribution, and observed licenses are recorded in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

The JR H3 Adaptive Cache is a clean-room implementation informed by publicly described ideas
from residual-based diffusion caching, EasyCache/TeaCache-style change estimation, block probing,
First Block Cache, and CacheDiT. No source, comments, function names, or distinctive code structure
from those projects were copied. The implementation was written against ComfyUI's native MiniMax H3
wrapper and block-replacement interfaces and remains licensed under Apache-2.0.
